  "extensibility": "Bar colours, stripes, stars and motion are in the [flag] block of ~/.config/omarchy/shell.toml. The bar layout is Omarchy's own (bar.layout in ~/.config/omarchy/shell.json), so you can move widgets with Omarchy's bar commands; update keeps a layout you changed. Menus and labels are QML in the plugin folders under ~/.config/omarchy/plugins/guy.*; update replaces them but first saves an edited plugin to ~/.local/state/omnemo-os/replaced/. Memory tuning is Omnemo's: ~/.config/omnemo/config.toml. The code is MIT: fork it and change anything.",

